# scripts/opcount: `kvbench bench get N` makes N gets from a std
# kv/memory store that holds 64 keys (ST3); the cost of one get is the
# slope between the two sizes. The control is hand Go with a map under a
# mutex; the floor is a bare map lookup.
unit get
sizes 200000 1200000
args bench get {n}
control benchmarks/kv/testdata/control
floor benchmarks/kv/testdata/floor
